Z||000002||1FST2M6||03-13-2000||11:36 AM||||Remove the deck lid and soldier in a replacement for whatever wires are toast shrink wrap over your soldiers! Get a hold of your local speed shop or Jegs or Summit and get some Thermo-TEC 2000* sticky tape. It has fiberglas in-between the 2 layers of reflectant Foil. i've wraped EVERYTHING under the hood of my car in Vitek loom then this over it. The Vitek loom just incase i need to get back in the harness for the new ignition/fuel system. The tape hasn't discolored at all and I've had it on the car since July of 99. The Tape is about $20 for 50' and it's 2" wide. (NOT hedder wrap) oh and NAPA carrys a 2lb. ABC Fire Extinguisher for $18.95.. I've got one beside my seat (took the e-brake out) and its DUSTY, but in the car just in case...  ||||reg||1
